[{"id":167675922,"discussion_id":"1a241d6ff52d8dafa2afa39b5737a124319af0ef","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*zzy__*](https://gitcode.com/zzy__), [*shen_weiling*](https://gitcode.com/shen_weiling) (2/2) | ✅ [*zzy__*](https://gitcode.com/zzy__) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n taomengyuan-hw, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-08T16:13:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-09T15:07:06+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167676266,"discussion_id":"8dc7afb8374092744f55661d7ae30fae75103718","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在解决MLA Prolog算子在批处理（batch）维度切分计算时，不同批次（batch offset）之间可能存在的计算依赖和数据竞争问题。具体而言，当处理非首个批次时，需要确保前一批次中向量核（AIV）对Ckv/Kr数据的处理已完成，以避免后续矩阵乘法（MatmulCkvKr）因共享工作空间（workspace）被覆盖而导致的数据错误。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案主要包含两部分：一是在核心计算函数`AicProcess`中，于执行`MatmulCkvKr`前增加条件判断，若非首个批次（`batchOffset != 0`），则通过`CrossCoreWaitFlag(FINISH_VEC_CKVKR)`等待向量核完成前一批次对Ckv和Kr数据的RmsNorm、Rope及Scatter操作；二是在向量核侧的`AivProcess`函数中，完成`RmsNormRopeScatterCkvKr`操作后，通过`CrossCoreSetFlag`设置对应的完成标志。此外，为支持该同步机制，在常量定义头文件中新增了同步标志`FINISH_VEC_CKVKR`。","created_at":"2026-04-08T16:15:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-08T16:15:05+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167700914,"discussion_id":"100f550d87f7634930f070d7b1a655425706fb3d","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-08T17:52:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-08T17:52:59+08:00","user":{"id":"67d28ec0729ec40f0ee0b819","login":"taomengyuan-hw","object_id":"67d28ec0729ec40f0ee0b819","name":"taomengyuan-hw","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ed/cc/759e309dc338441cf93bb66c66fe287ebf770fc557d1fd070f8b0635c0268026.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/taomengyuan-hw"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167701221,"discussion_id":"b43cf002dc9c6b424a21232357ee6e11a5348c63","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=7c069a216b1b4c2c99092524cb3c510a&projectName=CANN'>7c069a216b1b4c2c99092524cb3c510a</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=7c069a216b1b4c2